                  and tip the conflict into full warfare. Today, 9 more Palestinians 
                  were brutally killed in an unprecedented assault by the IDF on refugee camps.</o:p></font></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><o:p>And 
                  yet, obvious as <a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/cast/autopsy.asp">Sharon's 
