                  tell Sharon that ENOUGH IS ENOUGH!</o:p></font></p>
                <p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Below 
                  is an interface that will shoot off your letter to all the main 
                  US newspapers.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>Please 
