                <p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Please 
                  mobilize and ask your friends to join in a campaign to shake 
                  the media out of its comfortable trance. </font><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Fill</font><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> 
